       {
           "appId": "101524371",
           "eventType": "HEALTH_RECORD_EVENT$UPDATE$com.huawei.health.record.sleep",
           "subscriberId": "a2613ab0-19d8-4126-b18f-7779405b5992",
           "subscriptionId": "138sfdc8-a6c1-7yt5c-9759-26e33dhh5g67",
           "goalInfo": "null",
   	"alarmThreshold": "null",
           "subscriptionMode": 0,
   	"type": "HEALTH_RECORD_EVENT",
   	"subType": "UPDATE",
           "openId": "MDFAMTAxNTI0MzcxQGQ0Y2M3N2UxZTVmNjcxNWFkMWQ5Y2JjYjlmZDZiaNTY3QDVhNmNkY2FiaMTFhYzc4NDk4NDI0MzJiaNjg0MzViaYmUyMGEzZjZkNzUzYWVjM2Q5ZTgwYWM5NTgzNmY"
       }
   ]
   ```

2. 事件通知。

   订阅者对事件通知处理建议：
   * 建议使用签名验证。
   * 签名验证通过，返回204 No Content; 否则返回404 不支持。
   * 回调地址使用HTTPS协议。
   * 订阅者对通知事件的处理：异步到Health Service Kit云获取数据，避免耗时操作导致响应时延较高。

   **HTTP请求** ，请参见[订阅事件通知接口](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/HMSCore-References/subscriber-event-0000001076878214)

   ```screen
   POST
   https://www.example.com/healthkit/notifications
   ```

   **请求示例**

   ```screen
   POST
   https://www.example.com/healthkit/notifications
   ```

   **请求体**

   ```screen
   POST
   https://www.example.com/healthkit/notifications
   Content-Type: application/json
   x-notification-signature: ***
   {
       "eventTime":1607514090688,
       "eventType":"ACTIVITY_RECORD_EVENT$UPDATE",
       "metaData":[
           {
               "metaKey":"startTime",
               "metaValue":"1606856007879" // 更新数据的开始时间
           },
           {
               "metaKey":"endTime",
               "metaValue":"1606916007879"  // 更新数据的结束时间
           },
           {
               "metaKey":"activityType",    // 更新数据的类型
               "metaValue":"1"
           }
       ],
       "openId":"MDFAMTAxNTI0MzcxQGQ0Y2M3N2UxZTVmNjcxNWFkMWQ5Y2JjYjlmZDZiaNTY3QDVhNmNkY2FiaMTFhYzc4NDk4NDI0MzJiaNjg0MzViaYmUyMGEzZjZkNzUzYWVjM2Q5ZTgwYWM5NTgzNmY"
   }
   ```

   **响应体**

   ```screen
   HTTP/1.1 204 No Content
   Content-type: application/json;charset=utf-8
   ```

3. 拉取数据。

   根据推送过来的消息通知，向Health Service Kit服务端拉取数据，可以参见[多日步数统计场景示例](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/HMSCore-Guides/steps-delta-scene-0000001050779060)或者[读取运动记录数据场景示例](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/HMSCore-Guides/running-scene-0000001212292245#section2719231163210)。

### 场景事件订阅

1. 注册订阅记录。

   **HTTP请求** ，请参见[新增/更新订阅记录接口](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/HMSCore-References/subscriber-records-0000001088575341)

   ```screen
   POST
   https://health-api.cloud.huawei.com/healthkit/v2/subscriptions
   ```

   **请求示例**

   ```screen
   POST
   https://health-api.cloud.huawei.com/healthkit/v2/subscriptions
   ```

   **请求体**

   ```screen
   POST
   https://health-api.cloud.huawei.com/healthkit/v2/subscriptions
   Content-Type: application/json
   Authorization: Bearer ***
   x-client-id: ***
   x-version: ***
   x-caller-trace-id: ***
   {
     "subscriberId": "08666998-78f6-46b9-8620-faa06cdbac2b",
     "eventTypes": [
           {
               "type": "SCENARIO_GOAL_EVENT",
               "subType": "ACHIEVE",
               "eventType": "SCENARIO_GOAL_EVENT$ACHIEVE",
               "goalInfo": {
                   "createTime": 1654660859105,
                   "startDay": 20220608,  // 目标开始计算日期，注意需晚于目标创建日期
                   "recurrence": {
                       "unit": 1,  // 周期单位：日
                       "count": 30, // 整个周期30天
                       "expectedAchievedCount": 28
                   },
                   "goals": [
                       {
                           "goalType": 1,
                           "metricGoal": {
                               "value": 10000, // 设置达标值10000步
                               "fieldName": "steps",
                               "dataType": "com.huawei.continuous.steps.total"
                           }
                       }
                   ]
               }
           }
       ]
   }
   ```

   **响应体**

   ```screen
   HTTP/1.1 200 OK
   Content-type: application/json;charset=utf-8
   [
       {
   	"appId": "101524371",
   	"eventType": "SCENARIO_GOAL_EVENT$ACHIEVE",
   	"subscriberId": "1b57117f-8a7a-4584-b90e-149039216af6",
   	"subscriptionId": "3a82f885-97bf-47f8-84d1-21e558fe6e99",
   	"openId": "MDFAMTAxNTI0MzcxQGQ0Y2M3N2UxZTVmNjcxNWFkMWQ5Y2JjYjlmZDZiaNTY3QDVhNmNkY2FiaMTFhYzc4NDk4NDI0MzJiaNjg0MzViaYmUyMGEzZjZkNzUzYWVjM2Q5ZTgwYWM5NTgzNmY",
   	"goalInfo": "{\"createTime\":1654660859105,\"goals\":[{\"goalType\":1,\"metricGoal\":{\"dataType\":\"com.huawei.continuous.steps.total\",\"fieldName\":\"steps\",\"value\":10000.0}}],\"recurrence\":{\"count\":30,\"expectedAchievedCount\":28,\"unit\":1},\"startDay\":20220608}",
   	"alarmThreshold": "null",
   	"subscriptionMode": 0,
   	"type": "SCENARIO_GOAL_EVENT",
   	"subType": "ACHIEVE"
       }
   ]
   ```

2. 达标事件通知。

   订阅者对事件通知处理建议：
   * 建议使用签名验证。
   * 签名验证通过，返回204 No Content; 否则返回404 不支持。
   * 回调地址使用HTTPS协议。
   * 订阅者对通知事件的处理：异步到Health Service Kit云获取数据，避免耗时操作导致响应时延较高。

   **HTTP请求** ，请参见[订阅事件通知接口](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/HMSCore-References/subscriber-event-0000001076878214)

   ```screen
   POST
   https://www.example.com/healthkit/notifications
   ```

   **请求示例**

   ```screen
   POST
   https://www.example.com/healthkit/notifications
   ```

   **请求体**

   ```screen
   POST
   https://www.example.com/healthkit/notifications
   Content-Type: application/json
   x-notification-signature: ***
   [{
   	"appId": "101524371",
   	"subscriptionId": "3a82f885-97bf-47f8-84d1-21e558fe6e99",
   	"periodIndex": 0,
   	"periodStartDay": 20220608,
   	"periodEndDay": 20220608,
   	"goalAchieve": [{
   		"goalType": 1,
   		"metricGoal": {
   			"value": 10000.0,
   			"fieldName": "steps",
   			"dataType": "com.huawei.continuous.steps.total"
   		},
   		"achievedFlag": true //已达标
   	}
       ]
   }
   ```

   **响应体**

   ```screen
   HTTP/1.1 204 No Content
   Content-type: application/json;charset=utf-8
   ```

3. （非必要步骤）若需要查询某个场景事件订阅记录，对应的单周期内的目标达成结果值，可使用如下接口查询。

   **HTTP请求** ，请参见[查询场景事件结果](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/HMSCore-References/event-notifications-0000001283100022)。

   ```screen
   GET
   https://health-api.cloud.huawei.com/healthkit/v2/subscriptions/3a82f885-97bf-47f8-84d1-21e558fe6e99/achievedRecord
   ```

   **请求示例**

   ```screen
   GET
   https://health-api.cloud.huawei.com/healthkit/v2/subscriptions/3a82f885-97bf-47f8-84d1-21e558fe6e99/achievedRecord
   ```

   **请求体**

   ```screen
   无
   ```

   **响应体**

   ```screen
   HTTP/1.1 200 OK
   Content-type: application/json;charset=utf-8
   [    
       {
   	"openId": "MDFAMTAxNTI0MzcxQGQ0Y2M3N2UxZTVmNjcxNWFkMWQ5Y2JjYjlmZDZiaNTY3QDVhNmNkY2FiaMTFhYzc4NDk4NDI0MzJiaNjg0MzViaYmUyMGEzZjZkNzUzYWVjM2Q5ZTgwYWM5NTgzNmY",
   	"appId": "101524371",
   	"subscriptionId": "3a82f885-97bf-47f8-84d1-21e558fe6e99",
   	"periodIndex": 0,
   	"periodStartDay": 20220608,
   	"periodEndDay": 20220608,
   	"goalAchieve": [{
   		"goalType": 1,
   		"metricGoal": {
   			"value": 10000.0,  // 设定的目标值
   			"fieldName": "steps",
   			"dataType": "com.huawei.continuous.steps.total"
   		},
   		"achievedResult": "20023",  // 实际值
   		"achievedFlag": true // 已达标标记
   	}]
       },
       {
   	"openId": "MDFAMTAxNTI0MzcxQGQ0Y2M3N2UxZTVmNjcxNWFkMWQ5Y2JjYjlmZDZiaNTY3QDVhNmNkY2FiaMTFhYzc4NDk4NDI0MzJiaNjg0MzViaYmUyMGEzZjZkNzUzYWVjM2Q5ZTgwYWM5NTgzNmY",
   	"appId": "101524371",
   	"subscriptionId": "3a82f885-97bf-47f8-84d1-21e558fe6e99",
   	"periodIndex": 1,
   	"periodStartDay": 20220609,
   	"periodEndDay": 20220609,
   	"goalAchieve": [{
   		"goalType": 1,
   		"metricGoal": {
   			"value": 10000.0,  // 设定的目标值
   			"fieldName": "steps",
   			"dataType": "com.huawei.continuous.steps.total"
   		},
   		"achievedResult": "9800",  // 实际值
   		"achievedFlag": false // 未达标标记
   	}]
       }
